  },
  {
   "old": "The primary objective was to unify fragmented member data into a single, AI-powered source of truth. We developed a proprietary data pipeline that utilizes machine learning to identify high-risk health patterns early. We started by tracing the complete member journey, from enrollment and eligibility through outreach, care coordination, and follow-up. This revealed that the largest opportunity was not simply collecting more data, but making existing information available at the moment it could change an outcome.",
