   "max_bytes": 33,
   "scope": "all",
   "where": [
    "html",
    "cms"
   ]
  },
  {
   "old": "By deploying predictive analytics, we enabled Aetna to provide proactive care recommendations to millions of members. This shift from reactive to proactive service reduced administrative friction by nearly ninety percent. The architecture was built with a security-first mindset, ensuring that HIPAA compliance was maintained while leveraging the speed of modern cloud computing and real-time data processing for immediate clinical feedback. The new pipeline normalized inconsistent records, resolved duplicate identities, and created a shared event model for teams across the organization. This gave the intelligence layer cleaner inputs and gave product teams a reliable foundation for future services.",
   "new": "",
   "max_bytes": 704,
   "scope": "all",
   "where": [
    "html",
    "cms"
   ]
  },
  {
   "old": "The final phase focused on a dashboard for providers that translates complex AI predictions into actionable care plans. This tool has bridged the gap between raw data and meaningful patient interactions every day. We paired the dashboard with guided workflows that explain why a recommendation appears and what action should follow. Extensive testing with operations teams helped remove unnecessary alerts and ensured the system stayed useful during busy periods.",
   "new": "",
   "max_bytes": 463,
