   "max_bytes": 45,
   "scope": "all",
   "where": [
    "html",
    "cms"
   ]
  },
  {
   "old": "Predictive modeling improved early disease detection rates by thirty percent. The project worked because infrastructure, workflow design, and governance were developed as one connected system.",
