   ],
   "flex": true
  },
  {
   "old": "The project redefined what is possible in digital health. It proved that a legacy insurer could act with the speed and innovation of a specialized AI startup. Adoption grew because the platform reduced repetitive searching rather than adding another destination to an already crowded toolset. Each improvement was measured against time saved, member clarity, and staff confidence.",
   "new": "",
   "max_bytes": 380,
   "scope": "all",
   "where": [
    "html",
    "cms"
   ]
  },
  {
   "old": "Aetna now leads the market in personalized member experiences, driven by the robust AI foundation built by Daemon. This system doesn't just manage data; it actively interprets it to improve lives. As the healthcare landscape evolves, this infrastructure provides the flexibility needed to integrate new medical breakthroughs seamlessly, ensuring that Aetna remains a pioneer in the digital health revolution. Aetna now has an extensible foundation for personalization that can evolve as regulations, services, and member expectations change. The work demonstrates how a secure data strategy can become a visible improvement in everyday care experiences.",
