   "old": "Beyond the technical build, we prioritized HIPAA compliance and ethical AI standards to ensure data integrity. This holistic approach didn't just solve a technical bottleneck; it built a foundation of trust between the provider and the patient. We delivered a scalable framework that now supports millions of active users, proving that high-level AI can be both powerful and human-centric. We also introduced role-based views, audit trails, and clear confidence indicators so every recommendation could be questioned, reviewed, and improved. The result was a system that supported professional judgment instead of attempting to replace it.",
