   "old": "The core engine utilizes deep learning to identify seasonal demand spikes and regional health emergencies before they impact the shelf. By automating the reordering process, we allowed store managers to focus on patient consultations rather than logistics paperwork. The system also optimizes delivery routes for fleet vehicles, significantly cutting down on fuel costs and carbon emissions while ensuring that life-saving medications arrive on time. The forecasting engine was trained to account for seasonality, regional events, promotions, and unusual health patterns. Its recommendations were then translated into practical actions for managers, turning a complex prediction into a decision they could make quickly.",
